From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:49:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1115/3799] soh: rename D_801304B0 -> gUnusedSynthTable

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: u16[8] of alternating near-extreme values with no reader anywhere in the tree; the shape suggests a mixing or envelope table, but nothing uses it to confirm.
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c b/soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c
index bbd5a4124..b577bd29d 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/audio_synthesis.c
@@ -36,7 +36,8 @@ u32 D_801304A4 = 0x5CAEC8E2;
 u32 D_801304A8 = 0x945CC8E2;
 u32 D_801304AC = 0x94AEC8E2;
 
-u16 D_801304B0[] = {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_801304B0: u16[8] of alternating near-extreme values with no reader anywhere in the tree; the shape suggests a mixing or envelope table, but nothing uses it to confirm.
+u16 gUnusedSynthTable[] = {  // was D_801304B0 [LLM:GUESS]
     0x7FFF, 0xD001, 0x3FFF, 0xF001, 0x5FFF, 0x9001, 0x7FFF, 0x8001,
 };
 
